# Staged workflows

These workflow files are generated by the template and staged here; the active
copies in `.github/workflows/` are consumer-owned. Copy them into place with
credentials that have the `workflow` scope:

    cp -r staged/.github/workflows .github/workflows
    git add .github/workflows
    git commit -m "ci: add generated workflows"
    git push
